{
  "title": "Triagem de Laudos - Métricas da API",
  "uid": "triagem-api-dashboard",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 5,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Total de Requisições (por status)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total[1m])) by (status)",
          "legendFormat": "status {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Latência de Resposta (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "p50",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, endpoint))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{endpoint}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "p95",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, endpoint))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{endpoint}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "p99",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, endpoint))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{endpoint}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "QPS por Endpoint",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total[1m])) by (endpoint)",
          "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Taxa de Erro (%)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_errors_total[5m])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "erro %"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Requisições em Andamento",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "http_server_active_requests",
          "legendFormat": "ativas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Predições por Classe de Urgência",
      "type": "piechart",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(predictions_total) by (classe)",
          "legendFormat": "{{classe}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" },
        "pieType": "pie",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Latência de Inferência do Modelo (p50 / p95)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "p50",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(model_predict_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, classe))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{classe}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "p95",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(model_predict_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, classe))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{classe}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Confiança das Predições (p50 / p95)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "p50",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(model_predict_confidence_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "p95",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(model_predict_confidence_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Total de Predições",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(predictions_total)",
          "legendFormat": "predições"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Navegação entre sinais",
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "grafana" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 24 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Tríade de observabilidade\n\n- **Métricas**: este dashboard (scrape do `prometheus_client` em `GET /metrics`).\n- **Traces**: abra o dashboard **\"Triagem de Laudos - Traces\"**.\n- **Logs**: abra o dashboard **\"Triagem de Laudos - Logs\"**.\n\nNos logs, clique no campo `trace_id` para abrir o trace no Tempo; no trace, a opção *Logs* mostra os logs daquele trace no Loki."
      }
    }
  ]
}